        <mxCell id="mvp-schema-notes" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;" value="One bank: 0..* questions. Each question: exactly 1 bank.&lt;br&gt;FK questions.question_bank_id → question_banks.id: ON DELETE RESTRICT.&lt;br&gt;Index: ix_questions_question_bank_id (question_bank_id).&lt;br&gt;Bank names are NOT unique. UUID and UTC timestamps are assigned by the application.&lt;br&gt;Scope: Question Bank MVP only; users/roles are a separate auth migration." vertex="1">
